# tools/ used to be ignored wholesale. That was aimed at the 184MB of GENERATED data
# below, but it also excluded every tool in the repo — 416KB of code that produces all
# of champ-data. runner.js had no git history at all, and the apply-proposals chart-group
# fix that unblocked the bot and support lanes existed only on one drive. Ignore the
# generated output, track the code.
